{"op":"section.add","id":"01a122be-09e5-72a0-94d6-9515caa54abc","parent":null,"index":2,"title":"🎨 Installation"}
{"op":"section.add","id":"01a122be-09e5-72a0-94d6-9516d20d96d7","parent":"01a122be-09e5-72a0-94d6-9515caa54abc","index":0,"title":"Yazi CLI"}
{"op":"block.add","id":"01a122be-09e5-72a0-94d6-95175a99fc1e","section":"01a122be-09e5-72a0-94d6-9516d20d96d7","index":0,"text":"```bash\n# v25.5.28+\nya pkg add 956MB/vscode-dark-modern\n\n# pre v25.5.28 (deprecated)\nya pack -a 956MB/vscode-dark-modern\n```"}
{"op":"section.add","id":"01a122be-09e5-72a0-94d6-951813879412","parent":"01a122be-09e5-72a0-94d6-9515caa54abc","index":1,"title":"Manual"}
{"op":"block.add","id":"01a122be-09e5-72a0-94d6-9519d9d0aa77","section":"01a122be-09e5-72a0-94d6-951813879412","index":0,"text":"```bash\n# Linux/macOS\ngit clone https://github.com/956MB/vscode-dark-modern.yazi.git ~/.config/yazi/flavors/vscode-dark-modern.yazi\n\n# Windows\ngit clone https://github.com/956MB/vscode-dark-modern.yazi.git %AppData%\\yazi\\config\\flavors\\vscode-dark-modern.yazi\n```"}
{"op":"section.add","id":"01a122be-09e5-72a0-94d6-951a4c278c29","parent":null,"index":3,"title":"⚙️ Usage"}
{"op":"block.add","id":"01a122be-09e5-72a0-94d6-951b7892753f","section":"01a122be-09e5-72a0-94d6-951a4c278c29","index":0,"text":"Add the these lines to your `theme.toml` configuration file to use it:"}
{"op":"block.add","id":"01a122be-09e5-72a0-94d6-951c33bcf642","section":"01a122be-09e5-72a0-94d6-951a4c278c29","index":1,"text":"```toml\n[flavor]\ndark = \"vscode-dark-modern\"\n```"}
